            "text": "Music group the Velvet Underground released their self-produced Rock music album Bootleg Series Volume 1: The Quine Tapes on 2001-10-16. The album has a total runtime of 230.05 minutes and was recorded in St. Louis Missouri, USA. It was preceded by the band\u2019s album Squeeze."
        },
