            "text": "The rock album, The Bootleg Series Volume I: The Quine Tapes, was recorded in St. Louis Missouri in the United States and was released on 10-16-2001. The album has a total runtime of 230.05 minutes and was preceded by the band\u2019s album Squeeze."
        },
