            "text": "Bootleg Series Volume 1: The Quine Tapes was released on October, 16, 2001, has a run time of 230:05, and was preceded by Squeeze by The Velvet Underground.The Bootleg Series Volume I: The Quine Tapes was recorded in the United States but The Quine tapes were recorded in St. Louis, Missouri (but both are rock music genre)."
